{"id": "SGU_Episode_322", "title": "SGU Episode 322", "type": "structured", "description": "The Skeptic's Guide to the Universe, Episode 322 Transcript", "metadata": {"title": "SGU Episode 322", "date": "September 17 2024", "year": 2024, "month": 9, "day": 17, "rogues": ["Rebecca Watson", "Steven Novella", "Jay Novella", "Evan Bernstein", "Bob Novella"], "categories": [], "podcast_url": "https://www.theskepticsguide.org/podcasts/episode-322", "episode_number": 322}, "sections": [{"id": 0, "text": "You're listening to the Skeptics' Guide to the Universe, your escape to reality.\n", "title": "Introduction", "metadata": {"title": "Introduction"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 1, "text": "Sept 17, 1822: Presentation of Rosetta Stone", "title": "This Day in Skepticism", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "title": "This Day in Skepticism"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 2, "text": "", "title": "News Items", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "title": "News Items"}, "sections": [{"id": 3, "text": "http://www.physorg.com/news/2011-09-chinese-possibility-capturing-asteroids-earth.html", "title": "Chinese Scientists Plan to Capture Asteroid", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "links": ["http://www.physorg.com/news/2011-09-chinese-possibility-capturing-asteroids-earth.html"], "title": "Chinese Scientists Plan to Capture Asteroid"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 4, "text": "http://theness.com/neurologicablog/index.php/acupuncture-and-acoustic-waves/", "title": "Acupuncture and Acoustic Waves", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "links": ["http://theness.com/neurologicablog/index.php/acupuncture-and-acoustic-waves/"], "title": "Acupuncture and Acoustic Waves"}, "sections": []}]}, {"id": 5, "text": "http://saramayhew.com/wordpress/index.php/published-work/", "title": "Interview with Sara Mayhew", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "links": ["http://saramayhew.com/wordpress/index.php/published-work/"], "title": "Interview with Sara Mayhew"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 6, "text": "Item #1: A recent study has found that pregnant women exposed to magnetic fields may increase the baby\u2019s risk of developing asthma.\nItem #2: A top astronomer was recently quoted as having said: 'The genesis of life is as inevitable as the formation of atoms. Life exists on other planets and we will find it within 20 years\u201d\nItem #3: A species of manatee, thought to have been extinct, has been caught on video off the coast of Alaska. [9/7/2011 8:58:39 PM] Evan:\n", "title": "Science or Fiction", "metadata": {"timestamp": "", "hour": 0, "minute": 0, "second": 0, "title": "Science or Fiction"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 7, "text": "", "title": "References", "metadata": {"title": "References"}, "sections": []}]}